+physical ports. Their power balance is
+\begin{equation}
+ \dot H_0=-\alpha\dot q^{\mathsf T}M_f\dot q
+              +F\dot w(L)+\tau_B\dot\vartheta.
+ \label{mech:physical-power}
+\end{equation}
