+The normalized joint Gram matrix $G=A^{\mathsf T}A/800$ is
+\begin{equation}
+ G=\begin{pmatrix}5.16502121\times10^{-14} & 2.38379831\times10^{-11}\\2.38379831\times10^{-11} & 5.59508836\times10^{-6}\end{pmatrix}.
